1
00:00:00,076 --> 00:00:03,795
Pejabat Firaun ini dikubur
bersama alat perunggu...

2
00:00:03,795 --> 00:00:05,655
diduga alat medis.

3
00:00:05,655 --> 00:00:06,774
Padahal...

4
00:00:06,774 --> 00:00:08,482
ia tak pernah disebut dokter.

5
00:00:08,482 --> 00:00:09,782
Namanya Weni.

6
00:00:09,782 --> 00:00:11,907
Makamnya baru ditemukan di Saqqara...

7
00:00:11,907 --> 00:00:14,146
usianya 4.000 tahun lebih.

8
00:00:14,146 --> 00:00:15,209
Gelarnya banyak:

9
00:00:15,209 --> 00:00:16,233
wali kota,

10
00:00:16,233 --> 00:00:17,587
bendahara raja...

11
00:00:17,587 --> 00:00:18,567
tak ada dokter.

12
00:00:18,567 --> 00:00:19,772
Ahli mengingatkan,

13
00:00:19,772 --> 00:00:22,713
perkakas seperti ini sering
jadi bekal kubur pejabat.

14
00:00:22,713 --> 00:00:25,057
Tapi kalau terbukti alat medis...

15
00:00:25,057 --> 00:00:27,676
1.800 tahun sebelum Hippocrates!

16
00:00:27,676 --> 00:00:29,988
Kirim ke temanmu yang kuliah kedokteran!
